2026-06-25 18:47:47.443 [TestNG-tests-1] INFO  core.controller.MobileUIController - xsol diagnostic useful guides using the fluke meter to measure temperature 2017 v2 temperature to connect a probe to the multi meter first plug in the k type adapter making sure it is fitted the correct way round then plug the probe into the adapter use the probe in the normal way to measure the temperature as required the temperature setting of the multi meter is as the name suggests for measuring temperatures to work it requires a thermocouple probe c00 169 t00 146 or t00 210 be connected to the meter via a quot k type quot adapter block t00 159 if while measuring a temperature the reading goes down check that the adapter is connected to the meter correctly the polarity is important and is marked on the adapter block with quot quot and quot quot the reading can be changed between fahrenheit and celsius by pressing the quot range quot button below the display the current unit is shown in the upper right corner of the display vertical scroll bar 2 pages horizontal scroll bar 2 pages 0
