2026-07-01 17:08:44.012 [TestNG-tests-1] INFO  core.controller.MobileUIController - xsol ideal replacement pcb 2019 v3 the following issue has been identified with replacement of the isar board gc no h49852 appliances covered isar he icos he icos system he evo he evo he c esprit he mexico he and istor he care must be taken when changing from the older black board to the orange v9 board large numbers of the new boards have been returned under warranty as faulty which when tested by ideal were found to be in working order this has been confirmed by the diagnostics lab as an issue with the jumpers being located incorrectly care must be taken to identify the correct jumper settings do not just swap jumper setting from the previous board the appliance may not work correctly using the jumper locations from the existing board jumper settings are dependent on the appliance and the secondary display board version number please follow the instructions in the box carefully paying special attention to the first page and the display board version number or use the guides below click here for he appliances v9 pcb jumper settings click here for the isar m series pcb jumper guide vertical scroll bar 2 pages horizontal scroll bar 2 pages 0
